error[world-age]: `helper` is called in world older than its definition
 --> positive.jl:4:12
  |
3 |     @eval helper() = 1
  |     ------------------ defined by `eval` here
4 |     return helper()
  |            ^^^^^^^^ MethodError: method too new
  |
  = why: running function keeps world it started in; `eval` adds method to newer world
  = fix: replace with `Base.invokelatest(helper)`   [safe]
  = docs: corset explain world-age
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow world-age -- <reason>`

